        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have substantial relationships with manufacturers of non-equipment HVAC/R products, including Flexible Technologies, Southwark, DiversiTech Corp., Resideo, Mueller, Copeland, Johns Manville, Owens Corning, and Chemours.",
